      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Video generation — not reconstruction\nSelect model files and edit the prompts. Upload an image for I2V.\n\n**VAE family: wan21.** Wan2.2 14B uses wan21 (16 channels); 5B uses wan22 (48 channels).\n\nChoose Pro / Lite in Load LightVAE. To compare with the original, choose decoder=none and encoder=none; the connected base_vae is used unchanged. Keep the same seed. No turbo LoRA is used.\n\nSee comfyui/workflows/README.md for model downloads. LightVAE accelerates VAE decoding, not the sampler."
      ]
    },
